    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 408,
    "date_range": [
      386,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_3_unk#PL47.UNK.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_3_unk",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.UNK.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Scito autem te non honorificentiam, sed contumeliam divinæ gratiæ reddere si cœperis de tanti beneficii magnitudine dubitare;",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 408,
    "date_range": [
      386,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_3_unk#PL47.UNK.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_3_unk",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.UNK.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "imo illa omnia quæ de humili- tate atque humanitate Domini Salvatoris audivimus, ve- ra esse sine aliqua hæsitatione credamus.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 408,
    "date_range": [
      386,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_3_unk#PL47.UNK.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_3_unk",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.UNK.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et ideo magis gratias agamus, fratres, qui cum mereremur pœnam percepimus gratiam, qua gratia factum est ut dum mors debetur perditis, vita gratis donaretur indignis.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 408,
    "date_range": [
      386,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_3_unk#PL47.UNK.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_3_unk",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.UNK.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Altis- simi namque Salvatoris humilitas non ipsi aliquod intulit detrimentum, sed incrementum nobis contulit magnum, nec excelsum dejecit, sed dejectos erexit;",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 408,
    "date_range": [
